Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,An unprecedented astronomical\Ndiscovery was announced on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A mysterious planet had been found\Nfar beyond Pluto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.12,0:00:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Discovered at the edge of the solar system,\Nit seemed to have appeared from nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.80,0:00:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It was provisionally named "Number Ten,"\Nas the solar system's tenth planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.92,0:00:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Every kind of investigation\Nwas launched from Earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but no detailed information\Nabout the planet could be obtained.
